WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
breaths. It is time to put those rescue breathing

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.240
skills to work. Please head back to your mannequins.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.920
We are going to run through several rounds of practice to make sure you feel

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.120
confident in delivering these life-saving breaths.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.959
As you practice rescue breaths, your instructor will be checking to ensure

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:23.040
you are getting clear chest rise. Remember, we are not looking for big

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.799
forceful blows. We want gentle steady breaths that last

00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:30.799
about one second each. Once you've achieved clear chest rise,

00:00:30.799 --> 00:00:34.560
practice combining your skills by performing 30 chest compressions

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.840
followed by two effective rescue breaths and repeat.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.759
You want to move from compressions to breaths and back again as smoothly and

00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:44.959
quickly as possible.

